<P><FONT face=Verdana size=2></FONT>&nbsp;
<P><FONT face=verdana size=2><STRONG>UK ticket website </STRONG><A href="http://www.ticketmaster.co.uk" target=_blank><STRONG>www.ticketmaster.co.uk</STRONG></A><STRONG> has just announced the following: </STRONG>
<P><I><STRONG>We can announce that Madonna will be playing a second concert at the MEN Arena on August 14th 2004. Tickets go onsale on Friday 18th June at 9am. <BR>Ticket prices will be £84.50 ,£101.00 and £163.50 including booking fee.</STRONG> </I></P>
