<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">A local <STRONG>Miami</STRONG> radio station is giving away tickets to <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s <STRONG>Re-Invention tour</STRONG> in a contest called <STRONG>Diamonds and Divas</STRONG>. Winner also scores tickets to <STRONG>Jessica Simpson</STRONG>'s and <STRONG>Hillary Duffe</STRONG>'s shows plus a <STRONG>$1,000.00 Diamond necklace</STRONG>. <BR><BR>Listeners must listen to the cue song and be the 100th caller to win. <BR><BR><STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s <STRONG>Re-Invention Tour</STRONG> comes to <STRONG>South Florida</STRONG> on July 28th, 29th at the <STRONG>Office Depot Center</STRONG> which are sold out plus another two sold out dates at the <STRONG>American Airlines Arena</STRONG> in <STRONG>Miami</STRONG> on August 1st and 2nd. First two dates on each city sold out in minutes which prompted the promoter to add another show. Madonna last played during the <STRONG>Drowned World Tour</STRONG> for two sold out shows after a 13 year absence from <STRONG>South Florida</STRONG>. <BR><BR><STRONG>Keep on bringing info like this to our attention. Thank you!</STRONG>
